            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.40.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.5</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Polished the welcome screen, Quick Connect, and session search.</p><ul><li>A simpler welcome screen that adapts to narrower windows.</li><li>Clearer Quick Connect fields, keyboard focus, and invalid-port help.</li><li>A translated no-results message with a Clear Search button.</li><li>Includes the built-in updater and smaller signed update downloads.</li></ul>
]]></description>
