        <item>
            <title>1.40.5</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 13:37:41 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://macxterm.com</link>
            <sparkle:version>196</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.40.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.5</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Fixes terminal mouse handling, session import, and FTP filenames.</p><ul><li>Restore right and middle mouse press, drag, and release handling.</li><li>Correct SGR releases and urxvt mouse reports.</li><li>Keep imported sessions in the correct renamed folder.</li><li>Preserve accented and non-Latin FTP filenames.</li></ul>]]></description>
